  "description": "The Uwell Viscore Pro+ Prefilled Pod Kit is designed for vapers who want lasting power and modern simplicity. Capable of delivering up to 40,000 puffs, this advanced device combines a high-capacity 1900mAh battery with efficient 16W performance for smooth, reliable vaping all week on a single charge. A clear OLED screen keeps you informed at every step, showing real-time battery life, e-liquid level, and output mode for effortless control. Each kit features Uwell’s dual-pod system, with a 2ml prefilled pod linked to a 10ml refill reservoir. This design automatically replenishes the pod as you vape, removing the need for manual refills or coil replacements. Replacement Viscore Pro+ refill pods are available separately, ensuring long-lasting use and the ability to swap flavours quickly and cleanly. With two pod sets per kit, you’ll enjoy long-lasting performance and the flexibility to swap flavours quickly and cleanly. The Viscore Pro+ also features dual vaping modes — ECO for steady, efficient performance and SUPER for more vapour and a stronger hit. Combined with the 0.8ohm mesh coil, inhale activation, and Uwell’s 4-layer leak-proof system, the result is smooth vapour, full-bodied flavour, and a clean, mess-free experience. Uwell Viscore Pro+ Kit Flavours • Blue Edition Mr Blue + Fruit Mix • Cherry Edition Cherry Cola + Cherry Ice • Juicy Edition Juicy Peach + Pineapple Ice • Lemon Edition Lemon & Lime + Pink Lemonade • Mint Edition Fresh Mint + Lemon Mint • Raspberry Edition Blue Razz Lemonade + Blueberry Sour Raspberry • Red Edition Red Apple Ice + Blueberry Cherry Cranberry • Strawberry Edition Strawberry Raspberry Cherry + Milky Strawberry • Watermelon Edition Watermelon Strawberry + Watermelon Ice • Yellow Edition Banana Ice + Triple Mango Love the Viscore Pro+? You might also enjoy exploring our entire prefilled pod kit range Shop Uwell Viscore Pro+ Refill Pods",
